    "overview": "Write a memoir about a real moment that changed how you see yourself or the world.",
    "prompt": "Write a memoir about a real moment that changed you, even in a small way. Set the scene so the reader knows where and when it happened. Slow down the most important part, using dialogue and sensory detail. End by reflecting: what did this moment mean, and what do you understand now that you did not then? Revise at least once after a peer conference, and keep a sentence or two at the end noting the biggest change you made.",
